{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110933","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110933","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1211093301:1":{"text":"またお前たちか。まあ乗れや、代金は騎士団からもらってるよ。","source_cn":"又是你们。不管要去哪里，骑士团都已经付过钱了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B751B5FAE3F4815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211093302:1":{"text":"ホワイトマウンテン公国のスノーシダー町までお願いします！","source_cn":"我们要去白山公国的雪松镇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x725DE2EC9606C2EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211093303:1":{"text":"将軍が言ってたのですが、途中でストーミー海峡を経由するんですよね？","source_cn":"霍根将军说，会途经斯托密海峡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57C7AC5B0E63A804","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211093304:1":{"text":"ああ、だから将軍が帆船を手配したのか。俺の小舟じゃそんな遠出はできないもんなぁ。","source_cn":"原来是要出海。我这艘小艇送不了你们太远。不过将军已经打...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C39E4B27FA87DDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211093305:1":{"text":"バーク船までは俺が責任持って送り届けるから、海に出たあとは自分たちで目的地まで向かえよ！","source_cn":"我会把你们安安稳稳送上三桅帆船，之后入了海，航线就靠你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBABEEC9674B9BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu